            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li><code>kakeibo live</code>: Claude Code sessions that replied in the last 5 minutes, with their tokens.</li>
<li><code>kakeibo timeline</code>: today's sessions per project, with times, branch, the first prompt, and the prompts and files changed. Add <code>--project</code> for one project.</li>
<li><code>kakeibo project open &lt;project&gt;</code>: open a project's folder in Finder, or with <code>--in</code> in an installed terminal or editor.</li>
<li>The same three are tools in Kakeibo's MCP server.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
