            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Summarize my day (Settings &gt; Alerts, off by default): before the daily Alert, Kakeibo summarizes your three busiest projects with Haiku and puts the first Summary in the Alert. It uses a few thousand tokens of your plan for each.</li>
<li>Open a project in Finder, your terminal (Terminal, iTerm, Ghostty, Warp), or your editor (VS Code, Cursor, Zed, Xcode): the Open menu on the Today page, or the context menu of a project on the Projects page.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
